                "text": "Right now, a family of four in Vermont making $82,000 a year pays $6,970 for their health insurance on the marketplace\u2014it's already too expensive. But because of President Trump and Secretary Kennedy, their premiums will rise more than $30,000.\n\nThat\u2018s catastrophic. https://t.co/nRKw1bAs8Q",
