                "text": "After Secretary Kennedy accused Democrats of being shills for Big Pharma, I told him I was going to leave his hearing and bring my bill to the floor allowing Medicare to negotiate lower prices on medications.\n\nThis is the moment 33 minutes later when Republicans blocked it. https://t.co/4QW0vxvpK2",
